        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Laokhuan neimik kumna gaanhmeipu,",
            "Keipui nung saan gaimei suni",
            "Guang puni the, tingkao thanmei nun guai teile.",
            "",
            "Neila san gaimei tei aniu lani",
            "Champaan zianmei nunle.",
            "",
            "2. Laukhuan tingzin tei tat maan kanthe,",
            "Aniu panti ni naguang the,",
            "Tingkao Jerusalem namdai gaimei khoutei,",
            "Neila san gaimei tei aniu lani,",
            "Champaan zianmei nunle,",
            "",
            "3. Zianmei nunta riuni tingkao thang,",
            "Khoutei ringmei thingbang lim khou,",
            "Neila puilu thantei suani hallelujah.",
            "Neilana bam puni aniu lani",
            "Champaan zianmei nun e.",
            "",
            "4. Hei kandi rianra puiram khou hei,",
            "Ntam lak nipui bam kandi",
            "Khouhei makge, Pourui dam loumei kaidai nai",
            "Raguang zanta saanna aniu lani",
            "Champaan zianmei nunle."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
